        "Description": "Hello 47, you have been issued to take down a branch of the 99s known as &quot;The Black Mailers\r\rYour first target is Ann Wilkins, she was a normal suburban woman when she was corrupted with the power to control people like puppets.\r\rYour second target is Derek Swensen, he is a black mailer controlling the Suburban people in the area.\r\rYour third target is Bobby Ashcroft, he is pretending to be a Fumigator for the &quot;Evans&quot; Household.\r\rYour last target is Jerold Fryar, he is constructing a building.",
